<main class="legal">
  <div class="legal-top">
    <a class="cq-name" href="./">{{NAME}}</a>
    <a class="cq-call" href="./">Back to the quote page</a>
  </div>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-date">For the {{NAME}} instant quote page. Last updated {{UPDATED}}.</p>

  <p>{{NAME}} ("we") uses this page to give homeowners instant fence estimates. The page is run for us by TraceQuote, a product of Perché AI Solutions LLC. This policy explains what the page collects and what we do with it.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Address search.</b> The address you type is sent to Mapbox to find it and show satellite imagery.</li>
    <li><b>Your fence.</b> The fence you trace, the gates you add, and the styles and options you pick.</li>
    <li><b>Your details, if you ask for a quote or a measure.</b> Your name, email, mobile number, install timing, preferred measure time, and whether you agreed to texts.</li>
    <li><b>Page usage.</b> How the page is used (for example, which steps are reached), your browser and device type, and approximate location from your IP address, collected with PostHog. This does not include your name, email, phone or address.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To prepare your quote, contact you about it, and schedule your measure.</li>
    <li>If you agreed to texts, to text you about this quote and your measure. See the <a href="sms-terms.html">texting terms</a>.</li>
    <li>To keep the page working, prevent spam, and improve it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Only the service providers that run this page for us: Perché AI Solutions LLC (TraceQuote), Netlify (hosting and form storage), Mapbox (maps and address search), PostHog (page usage), and the messaging service we use for texts and email. We don't sell your personal information. Mobile numbers and texting consent are not shared with third parties or affiliates for their marketing.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep quote requests as long as we need them to serve you and keep business records, then delete them.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Reply STOP to any text to stop texts.</li>
    <li>To see, correct, or delete your information, contact us below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{{NAME}}{{CONTACT_LINES}}</p>
